],"desc":{"zh":"出自东胡，鲜卑族北部支系。东汉前期从大兴安岭北段南迁至呼伦贝尔草原，后继续西迁至阴山一带。三国时期鲜卑北部最强部落，北魏皇族先祖。拓跋力微在位期间吞并没鹿回部，拥有控弦之士二十余万。魏甘露三年，拓跋力微宣布承认曹魏为宗主国。其子孙在十六国时期建立代国，后发展为统一北方的北魏。","en":"Originating from the Donghu, a northern branch of the Xianbei people. In the early Eastern Han, they migrated South from the northern reaches of the Greater Khingan Mountains to the Hulunbuir Grasslands, later pressing West toward the Yin Mountains region. During the Three Kingdoms period, they stood as the most formidable Xianbei tribe in the North, serving as the imperial forebears of the Northern Wei dynasty. Under the rule of Tuoba Liwei, they annexed the Moluhui tribe, commanding over 200,000 mounted archers. In the third year of the Ganlu era of Wei, Tuoba Liwei formally acknowledged Cao Wei as suzerain. His descendants went on to establish the state of Dai during the Sixteen Kingdoms era, which eventually evolved into the Northern Wei dynasty that unified the North."},"talent":{"military":"9","commerce":"3","politics":"8"}}],"friendGroups":[],"body":{"name":"拓跋诘汾","height":"平均","shape":"较瘦"},"honorifics":[],"selfAddress":[],"specialNames":[],"vip":{"isVIP":0,"from":"0","to":"0"},"marriage":{"aiMarriageAge":"25","startPregnantAge":"0"},"scenarios":[{"story":{"id":"S10802","name":{"zh":"黄巾起义","en":"Yellow Turban Rebellion"},"year":"184","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1076","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[70,65,66,64,72,82],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"90","reputation":"3150","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13002","armor":"WP1018005","helmet":"WP1024605","horse":"WP1001015"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10215","name":{"zh":"汉末三杰","en":"Three Heroes of the Late Han"},"year":"185","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1076","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[70,65,66,64,72,82],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"3150","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13002","armor":"WP1018005","helmet":"WP1024605","horse":"WP1001015"},"couple":[]},{"story