{"story":{"id":"S11015","name":{"zh":"再出岐山","en":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1076","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[70,65,66,64,72,82],"title":1,"rank":"1","loyalty":"100","reputation":"6600","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13002","armor":"WP1018005","helmet":"WP1024605","horse":"WP1001015"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1076","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[70,65,66,64,72,82],"title":1,"rank":"1","loyalty":"100","reputation":"6600","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13002","armor":"WP1018005","helmet":"WP1024605","horse":"WP1001015"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1076","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[70,65,66,64,72,82],"title":1,"rank":"1","loyalty":"100","reputation":"6600","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13002","armor":"WP1018005","helmet":"WP1024605","horse":"WP1001015"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1076","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[70,65,66,64,72,82],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"3400","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13002","armor":"WP1018005","helmet":"WP1024605","horse":"WP1001015"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1076","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[70,65,66,64,72,82],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"3400","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13002","armor":"WP1018005","helmet":"WP1024605","horse":"WP1001015"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"东汉末年鲜卑索头部首领。北魏皇帝的先祖，献皇帝拓跋邻之子，神元帝拓跋力微之父。建安十八年继任首领。其父拓跋邻在位时有神人建议南迁，因年迈传位予拓跋诘汾。拓跋诘汾率领部落历经九难八阻的艰难困苦，在神兽引导下完成迁徙，到达匈奴故地。建安二十五年去世。","tc":"東漢末年鮮卑索頭部首領。北魏皇帝的先祖，獻皇帝拓跋鄰之子，神元帝拓跋力微之父。建安十八年繼任首領。其父拓跋鄰在位時有神人建議南遷，因年邁傳位予拓跋詰汾。拓跋詰汾率領部落歷經九難八阻的艱難困苦，在神獸引導下完成遷徙，到達匈奴故地。建安二十五年去世。","en":"A leader of the Suotou Xianbei during the late Eastern Han dynasty. An ancestor of the Northern Wei Emperors, he was the son of Tuoba Lin (Emperor Xian) and the father of Tuoba Liwei (Emperor Shenyuan). In the eighteenth year of Jianan, he succeeded as leader. During his father Tuoba Lin's reign, a divine being advised migrating south, because of his advanced age, Lin abdicated in favor of Tuoba Jiefen. Tuoba Jiefen led his tribe through immense trials and tribulations, completing the migration under the guidance of a divine beast to reach the ancient lands of the Xiongnu. He passed away in the twenty-fifth year of Jianan.","jp":"後漢末期の鮮卑索頭部の首領。北魏皇帝の先祖であり、献帝拓跋隣の子、神元帝拓跋力微の父。建安18年に首領を継いだ。父の拓跋隣の在位時、神人から南遷を勧められたが、高齢であったため拓跋詰汾に位を譲った。拓跋詰汾は部族を率いて幾重もの苦難を乗り越え、神獣の導きにより移動を果たし、匈奴の故地に到達した。建安25年に死去した。","kr":"동한 말기 선비 색두부의 수령입니다. 북위 황제의 선조이며, 헌황제 탁발린의 아들이자 신원제 탁발역미의 아버지입니다. 건안 18년에 뒤를 이어 수령이 되었습니다. 부친인 탁발린이 재위할 당시 어느 신인이 남쪽으로 이주할 것을 권하였는데, 탁발린은 연로하여 탁발힐분에게 자리를 물려주었습니다. 탁발힐분은 부족을 이끌고 갖은 험난한 고초를 겪은 끝에 신수의 인도를 받아 이주를 완수하여 흉노의 옛 땅에 이르렀습니다. 건안 25년에 세상을 떠났습니다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1046815","remark":"普武","surname":"拓跋","surnameTc":"拓跋","surnameEn":"Tuoba","surnameJp":"拓跋","surnameKr":"탁발","surnameOther":"","name":"诘汾","nameTc":"詰汾","nameEn":"Jiefen","nameJp":"詰汾","nameKr":"힐분","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"拓跋诘汾","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"184","city":"CS1076","gender":"0","rule":"70","force":"65","wise":"66","politics":"64","charm":"72","will":"82","ruleTalent":"8","forceTalent":"7","wiseTalent":"6","politicsTalent":"6"